A||||3||JayUSA77||How do i adjust my windows?||||4||
Z||000000||JayUSA77||07-22-2001||09:25 PM||||Okay i just put a new lock in on my driver side now my window seems to be loose and hanging towards the car. And the window will touch the door seal even when the door has about another inch and a half before the door will shut.  How can i adjust the windows so that its tight,<BR>Thanks,<BR>J<P>------------------<BR>86' Black Fiero GT||||reg||4
Z||000001||starfighter007@msn.com||07-22-2001||09:39 PM||||hopefully you still have your door panel off.If not shouldnt take you to long to get it off again.when it is off on the top of the door you will see two adjusting clips .they will have felt pad on them.there will be a little bolt behind them and there is a slot that once you loosen the bolt thatn holds the adjuster you will be able to slide the adjuster back and forth till you get your glass adjusted to where you want it.This will be very evedent to you once you see the adkusters on the top of the door.Hope this helps ||||reg||1
Z||000002||JayUSA77||07-22-2001||09:51 PM||||i think i get you your talking about the two bolts on the very top of the door with the little soft pads. Thanks, im going to try that, and ya it helps a lot thanks again<BR>J<P>------------------<BR>86' Black Fiero GT||||reg||1
Z||000003||rogergarrison||07-23-2001||03:39 PM||||you may have got the bottom of the glass out of its channel when putting in the lock. that should be obvious when you look inside.||||reg||1
